# API Reference — Petstore 3.0.3

## GET /pets

**List all pets**

Returns a paginated list of all pets in the store.
| Parameter | In |
|-----------|-----|
| limit | query |
| offset | query |

## POST /pets

**Create a pet**

Creates a new pet in the store.

## GET /pets/{id}

**Get a pet by ID**

Returns a single pet identified by its numeric ID.
| Parameter | In |
|-----------|-----|
| id | path |

## PUT /pets/{id}

**Update a pet**

Replaces a pet&#39;s data by ID.
| Parameter | In |
|-----------|-----|
| id | path |

## DELETE /pets/{id}

**Delete a pet**

Removes a pet from the store by ID.
| Parameter | In |
|-----------|-----|
| id | path |

## GET /store/inventory

**Get store inventory**

Returns a map of status codes to quantities.

## POST /store/orders

**Place an order**

Places a new order for a pet.

